1
00:00:00,019 --> 00:00:01,564
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,566 --> 00:00:02,994
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,134 --> 00:00:04,134
(Episode 71)

4
00:00:04,216 --> 00:00:05,764
So this is where you've been.

5
00:00:09,545 --> 00:00:11,426
How could you do this to me?

6
00:00:11,951 --> 00:00:14,027
How could you tell your dad
all my secrets?

7
00:00:14,745 --> 00:00:17,242
You know better than anyone
what'll happen to me!

8
00:00:17,532 --> 00:00:19,578
We're outside someone else's house.
Keep your voice down.

9
00:00:19,579 --> 00:00:22,685
Who cares? I'm so furious I could die!

10
00:00:24,193 --> 00:00:25,460
This is all your fault, Ji Hu.

11
00:00:26,298 --> 00:00:29,265
If my mom and I die, it'll be your fault.

12
00:00:38,138 --> 00:00:39,442
Well, look who it is.

13
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:40,870
Stay out of this.

14
00:00:40,872 --> 00:00:42,023
Why should I?

15
00:00:42,025 --> 00:00:43,744
She's my daughter, and he's my son-in-law.

16
00:00:43,745 --> 00:00:44,865
Son-in-law?

17
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:46,530
Son-in-law?

18
00:00:54,298 --> 00:00:57,662
You're raising another mistress.
Keeping it in the family, I see.

19
00:00:58,429 --> 00:00:59,631
How impressive!

20
00:01:10,652 --> 00:01:12,058
Go ahead. Tear it up.

21
00:01:12,799 --> 00:01:14,644
I'm still the official wife,

22
00:01:14,899 --> 00:01:16,127
and she's the mistress.

23
00:01:16,398 --> 00:01:18,538
Mom, let's go inside.

24
00:01:24,985 --> 00:01:26,383
I'm not throwing it.

25
00:01:26,892 --> 00:01:29,467
You're not even good enough
to be fertilizer.

26
00:01:30,098 --> 00:01:33,177
I saw the video of you
trying to run Ji Ni over.

27
00:01:33,602 --> 00:01:34,783
Just you wait.

28
00:01:34,785 --> 00:01:36,760
I'll run you over with my truck.

29
00:01:40,032 --> 00:01:41,032
Ji Hu,

30
00:01:41,034 --> 00:01:44,171
stop letting that crazy woman
lead you around and come inside.

31
00:01:45,939 --> 00:01:47,100
Yes, Mother.

32
00:01:51,658 --> 00:01:52,781
Go. Hurry.

33
00:02:03,818 --> 00:02:04,994
I'm scared...

34
00:02:05,112 --> 00:02:06,277
of how vicious she is.

35
00:02:07,887 --> 00:02:09,423
We're really cursed
to be tied to each other.

36
00:02:23,296 --> 00:02:24,567
Are you sure...

37
00:02:24,914 --> 00:02:27,206
those weren't your words?

38
00:02:27,312 --> 00:02:29,017
I've been thinking about that too,

39
00:02:29,255 --> 00:02:30,854
but I honestly don't remember saying that.

40
00:02:31,378 --> 00:02:33,898
It was after my conversation with you.
It doesn't make sense.

41
00:02:33,938 --> 00:02:37,018
But the voice sounded exactly like yours.

42
00:02:37,526 --> 00:02:38,735
What recording?

43
00:02:43,552 --> 00:02:46,485
Remember, you're all I have.

44
00:02:47,529 --> 00:02:48,687
Don't worry.

45
00:02:53,238 --> 00:02:54,804
What is this?

46
00:02:55,092 --> 00:02:56,749
With evidence like this,

47
00:02:56,751 --> 00:02:59,904
how dare you ask for my daughter?

48
00:03:00,085 --> 00:03:02,467
Mom, please calm down.

49
00:03:02,671 --> 00:03:04,492
Ji Hu's just as shocked.

50
00:03:04,632 --> 00:03:05,632
Shocked?

51
00:03:05,863 --> 00:03:07,571
I'm about to faint!

52
00:03:07,911 --> 00:03:09,817
If you can't get this overturned,

53
00:03:11,085 --> 00:03:13,281
I don't even want to imagine
what'll happen.

54
00:03:13,858 --> 00:03:15,985
You can't divorce her.

55
00:03:16,172 --> 00:03:17,988
You'll be stuck with Do Hee for good!

56
00:03:18,023 --> 00:03:19,775
No. That'll never happen.

57
00:03:20,153 --> 00:03:22,025
Hey, Im Ji Hu!

58
00:03:22,151 --> 00:03:24,911
What on earth are you doing
to my daughter?

59
00:03:24,913 --> 00:03:26,918
Mom, lower your voice.

60
00:03:29,478 --> 00:03:31,712
I think the recording was doctored.

61
00:03:32,552 --> 00:03:34,565
There's no way I said those things.

62
00:03:35,212 --> 00:03:36,358
Please believe me, Mother.

63
00:03:36,912 --> 00:03:38,810
Doctored? By AI?

64
00:03:39,099 --> 00:03:40,099
What?

65
00:03:41,145 --> 00:03:42,856
Like a voice scam?

66
00:03:43,325 --> 00:03:45,905
Right. I hear it's almost impossible
to tell these days.

67
00:03:45,972 --> 00:03:48,037
We should consult the attorney
and file an objection.

68
00:03:48,325 --> 00:03:49,987
We need to verify
whether the recording is authentic.

69
00:03:51,352 --> 00:03:53,050
Then the trial will be delayed.

70
00:03:53,249 --> 00:03:55,508
What? No, we can't have that!

71
00:03:55,752 --> 00:03:58,458
We need your marital status cleared ASAP!

72
00:03:58,525 --> 00:04:00,514
Then does Ji Ni have to keep
getting blamed?

73
00:04:01,098 --> 00:04:02,206
I'm sorry.

74
00:04:03,545 --> 00:04:05,035
Call the attorney right away.

75
00:04:06,057 --> 00:04:07,057
Yes.

76
00:04:13,599 --> 00:04:15,262
Mom, I'm sorry.

77
00:04:17,692 --> 00:04:20,537
Why did it have to be Do Hee,
of all people?

78
00:04:21,845 --> 00:04:22,845
You...

79
00:04:23,572 --> 00:04:24,572
have to win.

80
00:04:24,945 --> 00:04:26,577
You have to make her pay.

81
00:04:27,601 --> 00:04:28,601
I will.

82
00:04:30,502 --> 00:04:32,752
I'm hungry. Let's eat first.

83
00:04:33,265 --> 00:04:35,696
What should I make
for my future son-in-law?

84
00:05:02,545 --> 00:05:03,545
Why are you coming over here?

85
00:05:05,125 --> 00:05:07,737
Didn't you hear the war
outside the door earlier?

86
00:05:09,218 --> 00:05:11,265
That's why I stayed in here.

87
00:05:12,965 --> 00:05:15,050
They were making
some pretty serious death threats.

88
00:05:15,645 --> 00:05:18,362
Watch out for Do Hee.

89
00:05:18,478 --> 00:05:19,812
She's dangerous.

90
00:05:19,870 --> 00:05:20,870
I know.

91
00:05:21,145 --> 00:05:24,044
But when I think about it,
she's pitiful too.

92
00:05:24,496 --> 00:05:27,212
Her parents just gave her money
and cared too much about credentials.

93
00:05:27,538 --> 00:05:29,083
Even though our dad was like that,

94
00:05:29,195 --> 00:05:31,223
mom and grandpa kept us grounded.

95
00:05:31,225 --> 00:05:32,477
Hey, that's just an excuse.

96
00:05:32,551 --> 00:05:33,935
She hit someone with her car.

97
00:05:34,646 --> 00:05:36,347
Your motorcycle accident was bad enough.

98
00:05:36,349 --> 00:05:37,629
I don't even want to think about it.

99
00:05:38,251 --> 00:05:39,671
She has no moral compass.

100
00:05:39,672 --> 00:05:42,154
I get it. Don't worry.

101
00:05:43,498 --> 00:05:44,642
Are you sorting through Mai's clothes?

102
00:05:45,018 --> 00:05:46,444
Seeing you earlier made me realize...

103
00:05:47,145 --> 00:05:50,610
I've been neglecting
the search for witnesses.

104
00:05:50,808 --> 00:05:51,942
I told you not to.

105
00:05:52,898 --> 00:05:54,494
I'm doing it for mom.

106
00:05:55,392 --> 00:05:57,721
Grandpa's dying wish was for us
to find whoever caused your accident...

107
00:05:58,115 --> 00:06:00,079
and make sure they paid for it.

108
00:06:00,845 --> 00:06:02,979
I had the flyers printed
right after we went out together.

109
00:06:03,645 --> 00:06:06,660
Who's going to check
the police website anyway?

110
00:06:08,078 --> 00:06:11,912
People who hit someone with their car
and run away must be found and punished.

111
00:06:12,740 --> 00:06:13,740
Right.

112
00:06:14,491 --> 00:06:17,062
If you and mom feel that way, go ahead.

113
00:06:17,431 --> 00:06:20,708
I thought you'd throw a fit again,
but you've finally grown up.

114
00:06:21,198 --> 00:06:23,719
People call me an old guy now, you know?

115
00:06:25,625 --> 00:06:27,054
Something smells delicious.

116
00:06:28,926 --> 00:06:30,856
- Dinner's ready.
- Okay.

117
00:06:31,482 --> 00:06:32,715
I heard your boyfriend came over.

118
00:06:33,826 --> 00:06:35,787
Yes. I'm sorry.

119
00:06:36,052 --> 00:06:37,433
Given the circumstances,
it's understandable.

120
00:06:51,831 --> 00:06:52,935
Hello.

121
00:06:55,511 --> 00:06:56,885
Love is great.

122
00:06:57,438 --> 00:06:59,831
You have a perfectly good home,
yet you're sleeping here?

123
00:06:59,981 --> 00:07:02,150
Yes. I'll be staying for a few days.

124
00:07:02,278 --> 00:07:05,650
You're not imposing. This is my home too.

125
00:07:07,518 --> 00:07:08,518
Make yourself at home.

126
00:07:08,592 --> 00:07:10,860
- Mom told me.
- Thank you.

127
00:07:11,158 --> 00:07:12,478
Aunt's so nice.

128
00:07:12,612 --> 00:07:14,396
Is my mom really that nice?

129
00:07:15,070 --> 00:07:16,070
You...

130
00:07:16,865 --> 00:07:18,154
Ji Hu.

131
00:07:22,078 --> 00:07:24,562
No need to sleep in the living room.
Seung Hyun's room is spacious.

132
00:07:24,853 --> 00:07:26,729
- Mom!
- What?

133
00:07:28,894 --> 00:07:30,550
Okay. Do whatever you want.

134
00:07:30,561 --> 00:07:31,758
No, it's okay.

135
00:07:32,546 --> 00:07:34,292
It's fine.
It's not like it's the middle of winter.

136
00:07:34,446 --> 00:07:36,425
The living room is fine.
The weather's nice and cool too.

137
00:07:36,515 --> 00:07:38,181
It's nice that you're with Ji Ni too.

138
00:07:38,589 --> 00:07:39,589
Exactly.

139
00:07:41,212 --> 00:07:42,371
That's not what I meant.

140
00:07:43,531 --> 00:07:46,224
Don't tease Ji Hu. I won't let it slide.

141
00:07:46,712 --> 00:07:47,712
Mother.

142
00:07:50,558 --> 00:07:52,642
How can a man live
without a mother-in-law?

143
00:07:54,971 --> 00:07:56,110
Eat up.

144
00:07:56,312 --> 00:07:58,927
- You should eat too.
- Okay. Make me a wrap too.

145
00:07:59,864 --> 00:08:01,071
- I'll make one for you.
- Okay.

146
00:08:03,118 --> 00:08:05,083
I could die happy now.

147
00:08:07,958 --> 00:08:09,925
There's something to it.
You kids wouldn't understand.

148
00:08:10,612 --> 00:08:12,904
I didn't understand it back then, either.

149
00:08:13,032 --> 00:08:16,833
My mom used to say she'd die of happiness
or that the hardship would kill her.

150
00:08:17,145 --> 00:08:19,185
I used to wonder why she was like that.

151
00:08:24,738 --> 00:08:26,752
You seem really close to your brothers.

152
00:08:29,305 --> 00:08:31,875
Things aren't always what they seem.

153
00:08:32,057 --> 00:08:33,057
I know.

154
00:08:33,732 --> 00:08:35,992
I heard you hurt each other a lot as kids.

155
00:08:36,612 --> 00:08:37,612
It's hard to believe.

156
00:08:37,752 --> 00:08:39,646
I never thought we'd have a day like this.

157
00:08:40,252 --> 00:08:43,045
If mom hadn't lost all that money,
we'd never have had this chance.

158
00:08:43,125 --> 00:08:45,094
No matter how well I treated O Reum.

159
00:08:45,145 --> 00:08:46,488
Have you never called them your brothers?

160
00:08:47,089 --> 00:08:49,310
No. It still feels awkward.

161
00:08:50,265 --> 00:08:52,787
Still, he told Do Do Hee...

162
00:08:53,196 --> 00:08:54,910
I was their little sister.

163
00:08:55,066 --> 00:08:56,066
Really?

164
00:08:56,068 --> 00:08:58,429
When you were still unconscious,

165
00:08:58,474 --> 00:09:01,519
she was pretending to be a patient
to avoid questions about the accident.

166
00:09:01,709 --> 00:09:04,010
So I dragged her up to the rooftop.

167
00:09:04,733 --> 00:09:07,045
- Really?
- I kept pressing her,

168
00:09:07,093 --> 00:09:08,958
and her act was finally exposed.

169
00:09:09,305 --> 00:09:10,700
That's when...

170
00:09:11,762 --> 00:09:13,008
Director Cha said,

171
00:09:13,272 --> 00:09:15,233
"She's my little sister."

172
00:09:15,538 --> 00:09:18,775
That just gave everyone more reason
to mock our dysfunctional family,

173
00:09:18,991 --> 00:09:20,853
but I never thought he'd do that.

174
00:09:23,258 --> 00:09:25,054
When Do Hee was giving me a hard time,

175
00:09:25,086 --> 00:09:26,875
I came here and prayed.

176
00:09:27,645 --> 00:09:31,635
Back then, he told me
I should never have been born.

177
00:09:39,471 --> 00:09:42,710
If the trial gets postponed,
when will it be rescheduled?

178
00:09:44,432 --> 00:09:47,471
Even in the best-case scenario,
it'll take at least a month.

179
00:09:48,832 --> 00:09:49,832
A month...

180
00:09:50,952 --> 00:09:53,804
So until then, you...

181
00:09:54,132 --> 00:09:56,171
will still be Do Hee's husband on paper.

182
00:09:56,927 --> 00:09:57,927
Ji Ni.

183
00:09:59,612 --> 00:10:01,002
Even when I feel okay,

184
00:10:01,487 --> 00:10:03,477
just thinking about it gives me chills.

185
00:10:06,732 --> 00:10:07,931
Then don't postpone it.

186
00:10:08,119 --> 00:10:09,240
Let's go to trial.

187
00:10:09,805 --> 00:10:12,673
Wouldn't losing make things even harder?

188
00:10:13,385 --> 00:10:16,173
If it really comes to divorce,
there's no turning back.

189
00:10:21,065 --> 00:10:22,540
If that file was fabricated,

190
00:10:22,777 --> 00:10:24,302
there must be an original.

191
00:10:25,632 --> 00:10:28,376
To find it, we'd need to search
Do Hee's phone.

192
00:10:29,157 --> 00:10:30,460
Do Hee's phone?

193
00:10:36,352 --> 00:10:37,458
Mom.

194
00:10:38,188 --> 00:10:39,366
Are you okay?

195
00:10:40,645 --> 00:10:42,348
Now dad knows everything.

196
00:10:43,112 --> 00:10:44,650
He didn't hit you, did he?

197
00:10:47,232 --> 00:10:48,710
Mom, I'm sorry.

198
00:10:51,971 --> 00:10:53,352
I was wrong.

199
00:10:55,605 --> 00:10:58,804
I hate England! I'm scared to face dad!

200
00:11:00,992 --> 00:11:02,429
I'll win the trial.

201
00:11:04,038 --> 00:11:06,385
Of course. I can win.

202
00:11:07,765 --> 00:11:09,439
I've got everything prepared.

203
00:11:12,849 --> 00:11:14,146
I'll win and come back.

204
00:11:15,572 --> 00:11:16,572
Okay.

205
00:11:36,305 --> 00:11:39,633
I'll lock you both back
in the storage room.

206
00:11:45,880 --> 00:11:47,492
Did you sleep well?

207
00:11:48,525 --> 00:11:49,762
What's that on your face?

208
00:11:50,878 --> 00:11:52,223
My eyes are so swollen.

209
00:12:03,611 --> 00:12:04,804
The trial is today.

210
00:12:05,654 --> 00:12:06,654
Yes.

211
00:12:06,655 --> 00:12:09,517
Today, I'll prove
you made the wrong decision.

212
00:12:09,950 --> 00:12:11,018
You'll regret it.

213
00:12:11,118 --> 00:12:13,208
I've never regretted a decision
I've made in my life.

214
00:12:14,889 --> 00:12:17,525
Yes. I suppose you haven't.

215
00:12:20,385 --> 00:12:22,623
Is that how you speak to an elder?

216
00:12:22,752 --> 00:12:24,306
You have no manners.

217
00:12:24,891 --> 00:12:26,230
At least your eyes work fine.

218
00:12:26,232 --> 00:12:27,400
This woman, seriously!

219
00:12:29,638 --> 00:12:32,652
Win or lose, get all your things
out of this house today.

220
00:12:33,071 --> 00:12:34,927
If you won't,
I'll have someone else do it.

221
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:39,683
Seriously!

222
00:12:46,872 --> 00:12:48,527
You're really confident, right?

223
00:12:48,813 --> 00:12:49,813
Of course.

224
00:12:50,605 --> 00:12:52,056
Don't worry, Mother.

225
00:12:53,518 --> 00:12:54,852
Make sure you get there on time.

226
00:12:55,232 --> 00:12:56,694
You're going to lose your son.

227
00:12:57,372 --> 00:13:00,019
Even between parents and children,
there are lines you shouldn't cross.

228
00:13:01,818 --> 00:13:03,573
Na Ji Ni crossed that line.

229
00:13:03,992 --> 00:13:06,031
She started this war.

230
00:13:06,148 --> 00:13:08,818
Don't blame her for your mistakes.
Your accident came first.

231
00:13:21,765 --> 00:13:23,544
See? What did I tell you, Joong Bin?

232
00:13:29,592 --> 00:13:30,592
Sun Kyung.

233
00:13:31,264 --> 00:13:34,054
Do you really want to leave Ji Hu
with a woman like that?

234
00:13:34,055 --> 00:13:35,702
She's better than Na Ji Ni.

235
00:13:35,952 --> 00:13:38,825
I'd rather Ji Ni were an orphan.

236
00:13:39,602 --> 00:13:41,615
At least her mom wouldn't be a mistress.

237
00:13:42,266 --> 00:13:43,467
Seriously...

238
00:13:43,585 --> 00:13:44,827
And that woman...

239
00:13:46,365 --> 00:13:47,769
I don't even want to think about her.

240
00:13:55,885 --> 00:13:57,564
I'll stand by you to the very end.

241
00:13:58,252 --> 00:13:59,881
I'll never give up on you.

242
00:14:00,972 --> 00:14:02,952
So don't you dare show up in court.

243
00:14:03,003 --> 00:14:05,062
And apologize to Ji Hu
before it's too late.

244
00:14:06,485 --> 00:14:08,323
You'll really lose your son
if you keep this up.

245
00:14:10,325 --> 00:14:12,685
Why does everyone keep saying
I'll lose my son?

246
00:14:13,405 --> 00:14:15,362
Ji Hu is my child.

247
00:14:30,245 --> 00:14:31,442
You scared me!

248
00:14:32,362 --> 00:14:34,646
Make some noise when you walk in!

249
00:14:35,492 --> 00:14:38,292
Noise!

250
00:14:39,796 --> 00:14:41,413
Seriously...

251
00:14:41,492 --> 00:14:44,938
You've been a dad for ages.
When will you grow up?

252
00:14:44,963 --> 00:14:46,370
Who do you think you are,

253
00:14:46,901 --> 00:14:50,235
butting into decisions made
by the General and his wife?

254
00:14:50,260 --> 00:14:52,422
I'm Ji Hu's aunt. That's who.

255
00:14:53,505 --> 00:14:55,417
Having just one sister is such a pain.

256
00:14:59,178 --> 00:15:00,521
Miss Do Hee has left.

257
00:15:01,411 --> 00:15:02,579
Give me a hand with this.

258
00:15:06,484 --> 00:15:08,466
"Miss," my foot.

259
00:15:30,945 --> 00:15:32,730
The General told me to pack up her things.

260
00:15:33,256 --> 00:15:34,723
That's my brother-in-law.

261
00:15:35,169 --> 00:15:37,175
He sure knows how to change sides.

262
00:15:47,431 --> 00:15:48,431
Hey, by the way,

263
00:15:48,514 --> 00:15:50,514
how do we unlock Do Hee's phone?

264
00:15:51,172 --> 00:15:52,309
The password's her own birthday.

265
00:15:52,334 --> 00:15:53,959
Figures.

266
00:15:56,647 --> 00:15:59,288
Ji Ni asked Do Hee to come. Let's go.

267
00:15:59,313 --> 00:16:00,313
Hurry.

268
00:16:14,964 --> 00:16:17,002
You really like empty lots like this.

269
00:16:17,809 --> 00:16:19,155
Do you miss the old days?

270
00:16:20,047 --> 00:16:21,047
Not a chance.

271
00:16:21,072 --> 00:16:23,588
I spent over a decade trapped
in that nightmare.

272
00:16:24,638 --> 00:16:26,774
- It's time we went our separate ways.
- Do you think that'll happen?

273
00:16:28,252 --> 00:16:29,674
Anyway,

274
00:16:30,071 --> 00:16:31,746
this is the perfect place to say goodbye.

275
00:16:39,852 --> 00:16:41,444
Let's capture our last moment together.

276
00:16:42,020 --> 00:16:43,078
Smile.

277
00:16:44,441 --> 00:16:45,441
Ji Hu.

278
00:16:45,651 --> 00:16:47,189
- What now?
- That recording...

279
00:16:47,618 --> 00:16:48,656
is fake, isn't it?

280
00:16:48,682 --> 00:16:50,169
The painting was fake too.

281
00:16:51,506 --> 00:16:52,506
No, it isn't.

282
00:16:53,222 --> 00:16:56,318
What? You think I'm afraid
you'll find something on my phone?

283
00:16:56,948 --> 00:16:57,948
Go ahead.

284
00:16:59,977 --> 00:17:02,059
You're a mistress, plain and simple.

285
00:17:02,747 --> 00:17:04,720
Your misery is my happiness.

286
00:17:04,752 --> 00:17:06,513
You think you can just say
anything you want?

287
00:17:06,514 --> 00:17:08,406
You need to get a grip too, Tae O.

288
00:17:08,952 --> 00:17:10,201
You're doing all this
because you like her.

289
00:17:10,226 --> 00:17:11,348
And what about you?

290
00:17:11,751 --> 00:17:13,464
Do you really think Ji Hu will come back
to you if you act like this?

291
00:17:13,489 --> 00:17:14,764
That's why...

292
00:17:15,170 --> 00:17:16,623
I have to destroy their relationship.

293
00:17:16,827 --> 00:17:17,907
Do Do Hee!

294
00:17:21,001 --> 00:17:23,918
You're taking forever
to go through one phone.

295
00:17:24,340 --> 00:17:26,147
Court is about to start.

296
00:17:42,311 --> 00:17:43,927
Yes, Counselor. I'm working on it now.

297
00:17:44,412 --> 00:17:45,621
Please just delay the hearing.

298
00:17:46,390 --> 00:17:48,090
No, we can't postpone the hearing.

299
00:17:48,612 --> 00:17:49,966
I'll find the evidence. I promise.

300
00:17:50,829 --> 00:17:51,829
Yes.

301
00:17:57,145 --> 00:17:58,437
It's full of recordings.

302
00:17:58,461 --> 00:18:00,461
(Recordings)

303
00:18:05,738 --> 00:18:06,865
Jung A.

304
00:18:06,989 --> 00:18:08,810
Why are you here? Where's Seung Hyun?

305
00:18:09,402 --> 00:18:11,292
He's handing out flyers,

306
00:18:11,693 --> 00:18:13,067
so I'm covering a two-hour shift.

307
00:18:13,092 --> 00:18:15,048
Ever since I handed over the cafe,

308
00:18:15,072 --> 00:18:16,846
I've lost count of how many times
I've had to fill in.

309
00:18:16,870 --> 00:18:18,667
Flyers? What kind?

310
00:18:18,692 --> 00:18:21,487
They're looking for witnesses
to Director Cha's motorcycle accident.

311
00:18:22,011 --> 00:18:25,464
He never really shows any signs of it,
so I'd even forgotten he was hurt.

312
00:18:25,488 --> 00:18:27,038
Really?

313
00:18:27,225 --> 00:18:30,708
I don't know why they're making
such a fuss over finding someone.

314
00:18:30,778 --> 00:18:33,054
He left a few flyers here
for us to give to customers.

315
00:18:33,231 --> 00:18:34,336
There.

316
00:18:37,279 --> 00:18:39,279
(Witnesses Wanted)

317
00:18:42,465 --> 00:18:43,904
A witness came by.

318
00:18:43,928 --> 00:18:46,264
My heart was pounding like crazy earlier.

319
00:18:46,712 --> 00:18:47,862
Why did you do it?

320
00:18:48,245 --> 00:18:50,876
Why did that woman come back here?

321
00:18:50,901 --> 00:18:52,543
She moved back to this neighborhood.

322
00:18:52,918 --> 00:18:55,212
She brought rice cakes
because she opened a shop nearby.

323
00:18:56,257 --> 00:18:58,253
I'll take...

324
00:18:58,609 --> 00:19:00,266
those flyers and hand them out.

325
00:19:02,504 --> 00:19:03,504
What?

326
00:19:11,958 --> 00:19:13,265
Have a good day.

327
00:19:15,616 --> 00:19:16,651
Thank you.

328
00:19:24,312 --> 00:19:25,962
- Hello.
- Seung Hyun.

329
00:19:25,986 --> 00:19:27,578
Sir,

330
00:19:27,603 --> 00:19:29,214
can I leave these here?

331
00:19:29,239 --> 00:19:30,778
So customers can see them
when they come and go.

332
00:19:30,803 --> 00:19:32,480
About your brother's accident?

333
00:19:32,697 --> 00:19:33,955
Sure, go ahead.

334
00:19:34,019 --> 00:19:35,019
Thank you.

335
00:19:35,836 --> 00:19:36,898
Thank you!

336
00:20:06,631 --> 00:20:08,296
Just leave them there.

337
00:20:08,321 --> 00:20:09,383
Thank you.

338
00:20:11,351 --> 00:20:12,508
Have a good day.

339
00:20:20,205 --> 00:20:21,540
Hello.

340
00:20:21,816 --> 00:20:23,396
Hello. Welcome.

341
00:20:23,421 --> 00:20:25,464
- Please wait a moment.
- Okay.

342
00:20:27,455 --> 00:20:30,248
I'm a little short on time.
I'll come back another day.

343
00:20:32,958 --> 00:20:34,067
Thank you.

344
00:21:10,919 --> 00:21:12,125
I'm dying here.

345
00:21:12,486 --> 00:21:14,996
I'll die before anyone else.
I'm practically dying already.

346
00:21:16,992 --> 00:21:19,116
I should've just given Cha Min Ki
ten years.

347
00:21:19,140 --> 00:21:21,029
Now I'm stuck serving ten years here.

348
00:21:28,872 --> 00:21:30,278
(Witnesses Wanted)

349
00:21:30,280 --> 00:21:32,415
(A reward will be offered.)

350
00:21:51,973 --> 00:21:53,973
(Seoul Family Court)

351
00:21:55,230 --> 00:21:56,473
Hi!

352
00:21:57,375 --> 00:21:58,931
Hello, husband!

353
00:22:02,298 --> 00:22:03,618
And hello to you, mistress.

354
00:22:03,620 --> 00:22:06,378
- Watch what you say.
- It's all true so far.

355
00:22:06,403 --> 00:22:08,546
You didn't find anything on my phone.

356
00:22:08,825 --> 00:22:09,855
Ji Hu,

357
00:22:10,205 --> 00:22:12,205
you'll be punished
for abandoning your official wife.

358
00:22:12,685 --> 00:22:13,869
Just look at her dad.

359
00:22:13,893 --> 00:22:15,216
He dropped dead out of nowhere.

360
00:22:15,691 --> 00:22:17,994
- Don't you know?
- Don't talk about my dad.

361
00:22:18,768 --> 00:22:19,768
Fine.

362
00:22:19,958 --> 00:22:21,476
Like mother, like daughter. Good luck.

363
00:22:22,109 --> 00:22:24,564
Of all the men you could have had
an affair with, you chose my husband?

364
00:22:25,548 --> 00:22:26,634
Shut your mouth.

365
00:22:26,784 --> 00:22:29,752
I'll prove that you tampered
with that recording.

366
00:22:30,120 --> 00:22:31,127
Whatever.

367
00:22:31,952 --> 00:22:34,469
Father, you're here?

368
00:22:34,805 --> 00:22:37,204
Are you really that worried
about your daughter-in-law, the mistress?

369
00:22:40,579 --> 00:22:41,875
Seriously.

370
00:23:04,110 --> 00:23:06,733
Is all this stuff really for one person?

371
00:23:07,184 --> 00:23:09,147
She's blinded by money.

372
00:23:09,239 --> 00:23:12,227
With all the money going to her,
there's nothing left for anyone else.

373
00:23:12,252 --> 00:23:14,656
- She's so greedy.
- Yeah.

374
00:23:35,079 --> 00:23:36,562
(Guess Who?)

375
00:23:39,197 --> 00:23:40,197
"Guess Who?"

376
00:23:47,465 --> 00:23:48,499
Hello?

377
00:23:48,623 --> 00:23:51,645
Ms. Do Do Hee,
the amount you deposited is wrong.

378
00:23:51,784 --> 00:23:55,252
The trial is today. If you play dirty,
I won't let it slide.

379
00:23:56,167 --> 00:23:58,345
- What trial?
- The annulment tria...

380
00:23:58,369 --> 00:23:59,369
What?

381
00:23:59,652 --> 00:24:01,099
Aren't you Do Do Hee?

382
00:24:01,123 --> 00:24:02,506
Yes, I'm Do Do Hee.

383
00:24:02,663 --> 00:24:04,853
Who are you?

384
00:24:04,990 --> 00:24:06,221
- Seriously!
- Who...

385
00:24:08,952 --> 00:24:09,970
What's going on?

386
00:24:19,154 --> 00:24:21,168
- You drive.
- What?

387
00:24:21,225 --> 00:24:23,656
Let's hurry and get to Ji Hu. Okay?

388
00:24:25,971 --> 00:24:28,785
- Hurry!
- Okay.

389
00:24:31,113 --> 00:24:32,113
Let's go.

390
00:24:33,552 --> 00:24:34,706
Starting the engine.

391
00:24:35,585 --> 00:24:38,265
Today, we need to convince the judge
that neither of us agreed to it.

392
00:24:38,289 --> 00:24:39,694
That's our best shot.

393
00:24:39,926 --> 00:24:42,817
Do you think that'll work?
Your voice is clearly on the recording.

394
00:24:42,842 --> 00:24:44,751
We need to prove the recording
was tampered with,

395
00:24:44,918 --> 00:24:46,391
or find the original.

396
00:24:46,692 --> 00:24:48,535
We probably can't resolve this today.

397
00:24:49,026 --> 00:24:50,635
The ruling will be delayed.

398
00:24:55,032 --> 00:24:56,387
Don't worry about me.

399
00:24:56,658 --> 00:24:58,200
I'm fine. I can wait.

400
00:24:59,823 --> 00:25:00,829
Ji Hu!

401
00:25:03,925 --> 00:25:05,074
Ji Hu!

402
00:25:05,099 --> 00:25:06,165
Ma'am!

403
00:25:06,275 --> 00:25:07,275
This...

404
00:25:09,578 --> 00:25:10,652
There's no passcode.

405
00:25:10,677 --> 00:25:11,972
I checked it on the way here.

406
00:25:12,090 --> 00:25:13,306
There's all sorts of stuff on it.

407
00:25:15,251 --> 00:25:17,115
Look, I even talked with someone.

408
00:25:17,140 --> 00:25:19,003
Find this person.

409
00:25:19,027 --> 00:25:20,210
Something's going on.

410
00:25:20,318 --> 00:25:22,371
Ma'am, have some water.

411
00:25:22,692 --> 00:25:23,853
She has another phone?

412
00:25:23,878 --> 00:25:25,415
She has a phone for her alternate account.

413
00:25:26,050 --> 00:25:28,314
How did I not think of that?

414
00:25:29,564 --> 00:25:31,558
Thank you, ma'am.

415
00:25:32,292 --> 00:25:35,499
Your dad told us
to pack up Do Hee's things.

416
00:25:35,638 --> 00:25:37,204
That turned out to be a brilliant move.

417
00:25:37,545 --> 00:25:39,764
I'll check with the lawyer
and be right back.

418
00:25:40,535 --> 00:25:41,688
Good luck.

419
00:25:51,778 --> 00:25:53,398
- Register our marriage?
- Yeah.

420
00:25:53,423 --> 00:25:55,130
Your mom says we should too.

421
00:25:55,155 --> 00:25:56,850
I'm so happy.

422
00:25:57,274 --> 00:25:59,429
Okay, let's do that. I'll call you later.

423
00:26:00,064 --> 00:26:01,064
Ji Hu,

424
00:26:01,108 --> 00:26:02,644
don't change your mind.

425
00:26:03,199 --> 00:26:04,201
This...

426
00:26:04,338 --> 00:26:05,868
is an AI-generated voice recording.

427
00:26:06,313 --> 00:26:07,531
This is the original recording.

428
00:26:08,318 --> 00:26:10,050
I'll send out digital invitations.

429
00:26:10,278 --> 00:26:12,858
- And let's register our marriage.
- Register our marriage?

430
00:26:12,883 --> 00:26:15,132
Yeah, your mom says we should too.

431
00:26:15,157 --> 00:26:16,798
I'm so happy.

432
00:26:17,358 --> 00:26:18,670
Don't do anything just yet.

433
00:26:19,183 --> 00:26:21,262
- Why?
- I need some time to think.

434
00:26:21,451 --> 00:26:23,522
I'll call you later. Just wait.

435
00:26:25,385 --> 00:26:26,652
And that afternoon,

436
00:26:26,717 --> 00:26:30,133
my client met with Ms. Do Do Hee
and told her he wanted to break up.

437
00:26:31,241 --> 00:26:32,339
On this phone,

438
00:26:32,457 --> 00:26:34,160
we found conversations Ms. Do Do Hee had
under the name Do Do Hye...

439
00:26:34,184 --> 00:26:36,000
with an AI technician.

440
00:26:36,024 --> 00:26:37,140
And just moments ago,

441
00:26:37,460 --> 00:26:41,410
the phone also recorded a call
with my client's aunt.

442
00:26:41,826 --> 00:26:44,903
The phone appears to have recorded
all calls automatically.

443
00:26:46,018 --> 00:26:47,022
I submit this as evidence.

444
00:26:52,805 --> 00:26:55,272
Why are you going through
someone else's phone?

445
00:26:55,296 --> 00:26:56,359
You!

446
00:26:56,383 --> 00:26:59,074
That's mine! Give it back!

447
00:26:59,207 --> 00:27:00,493
I said give it back!

448
00:27:00,826 --> 00:27:02,233
You're all dead!

449
00:27:02,258 --> 00:27:03,718
I'll kill every last one of you!

450
00:27:03,742 --> 00:27:04,892
Hey!

451
00:27:38,711 --> 00:27:40,468
The marriage between the plaintiff
and the defendant...

452
00:27:40,492 --> 00:27:41,982
is hereby declared null and void.

453
00:27:42,478 --> 00:27:44,809
The defendant shall bear the court costs.

454
00:27:57,023 --> 00:28:00,475
Hey!

455
00:28:00,500 --> 00:28:02,422
You!

456
00:28:02,446 --> 00:28:04,215
Do Do Hee! What do you think you're doing?

457
00:28:06,165 --> 00:28:07,562
I won't let you get away with this.

458
00:28:07,836 --> 00:28:09,636
Just you wait!

459
00:28:30,819 --> 00:28:34,031
(Family Register)

460
00:28:34,056 --> 00:28:35,868
Our families will never become in-laws.

461
00:28:35,892 --> 00:28:38,488
Don't touch him. He's my son-in-law.

462
00:28:38,513 --> 00:28:39,898
He's mine now.

463
00:28:39,923 --> 00:28:41,051
So this is where it was.

464
00:28:41,076 --> 00:28:44,199
I'll get my dear Ji Ni married off
and finally live on my own.

465
00:28:44,224 --> 00:28:45,425
Don't think this is over.

466
00:28:45,450 --> 00:28:47,436
I won't stand by and watch
Na Ji Ni and Ji Hu live happily.

467
00:28:47,438 --> 00:28:49,260
What are you doing?
This could get serious.

468
00:28:49,285 --> 00:28:50,466
Your punishment starts now.

469
00:28:50,491 --> 00:28:52,019
If your parents didn't raise you right,

470
00:28:52,105 --> 00:28:53,432
it's time you learned.

471
00:28:55,197 --> 00:28:57,197
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
